  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, if you Pendulum Summon a \"D/D/D\"
    monster(s): You can target 3 monsters your opponent controls with the same Type
    or Attribute as each other; Tribute 2 of those 3 face-up monsters, and if you
    do, the third gains ATK/DEF equal to the total ATK/DEF the Tributed monsters
    had on the field.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nYou can discard 1 other \"D/D\" monster;
    Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned:
    You can add 1 \"D/D\" monster with 0 ATK or DEF from your Deck to your hand.
    You can only use each effect of \"D/D Count Surveyor\" once per turn."
